ons, planSize);","             }","             return p;","         });","     }"," ","     private LogicalPlan resolveViewReference(UnresolvedRelation ur, Map<String, LogicalPlan> viewDefinitions, boolean keepViewIdentity) {","+        // A view whose own definition SETs a boundary-scoped setting keeps its identity like a caller-side setting","+        // would make it, whatever this level's flag says; mirrors ViewResolver#resolve.","+        keepViewIdentity = keepViewIdentity","+            || Arrays.stream(ur.indexPattern().indexPattern().split(\"\\\\s*\\\\,\\\\s*\"))","+                .anyMatch(name -> viewSettings.getOrDefault(name, ViewQuerySettings.DEFAULTS).requiresViewIdentity());","         List<LogicalPlan> resolved = Arrays.stream(ur.indexPattern().indexPattern().split(\"\\\\s*\\\\,\\\\s*\")).map(indexPattern -> {","             var view = viewDefinitions.get(indexPattern);","             return view == null","@@ -779,6 +793,41 @@ private LogicalPlan resolveViewReference(UnresolvedRelation ur, Map<String, Logi","         }","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Resolves views nested inside one expansion. A {@link BranchPlan} view branch is resolved under that view's own","+     * {@link ViewQuerySettings#requiresViewIdentity()}; an inlined body (a view that did not keep identity) nests with","+     * identity off, which is what a definition without boundary-scoped {@code SET}s means.","+     */","+    private LogicalPlan resolveExpandedViewBodies(LogicalPlan resolved, Map<String, LogicalPlan> viewDefinitions, PlanSize planSize) {","+        if (resolved instanceof BranchPlan branchPlan && hasViewBranch(branchPlan)) {","+            List<LogicalPlan> children = branchPlan.children();","+            List<LogicalPlan> newChildren = new ArrayList<>(children.size());","+            boolean changed = false;","+            for (int i = 0; i < children.size(); i++) {","+                LogicalPlan child = children.get(i);","+                boolean nestedIdentity 